OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers leave plane after knife
OL,4,Afound in wheelchair                    
OL,6,FPassengers had to disembark a flight   
OL,7,Fbound for Tenerife after a kitchen     
OL,8,Fknife was found inside a motorised     
OL,9,Fwheelchair while it was being loaded   
OL,10,Finto the hold.                         
OL,12,FLeicestershire Police said at 08:50 GMT
OL,13,Fon Saturday, officers were called to an
OL,14,Faircraft at East Midlands Airport,     
OL,15,Fafter it was reported the wheelchair   
OL,16,Fwas being collapsed - ready to be      
OL,17,Fstored - when the seven-inch blade fell
OL,18,Fout of the chair.                      
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
