OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers leave plane after knife
OL,4,Afound in wheelchair                    
OL,6,FThe passenger using the wheelchair and 
OL,7,Ftheir companion were removed from the  
OL,8,Fflight as a precaution, the force      
OL,9,Fadded.                                 
OL,11,FOfficers said no criminal offences were
OL,12,Fidentified, and the incident was passed
OL,13,Fto airport security for further        
OL,14,Finvestigation.                         
